-- Q9: Risk Assessment [hard/L1]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AU-C 315.26, the auditor must identify risks by understanding the entity''s environment, including operational changes. Simultaneous changes in revenue recognition policy and ERP systems create compound inherent risk because new processes may contain errors, staff may lack training on revised policies, and data migration introduces misstatement risk.
